	(property "V2_part_selection" "Replaces original AA1608LSYSK with APT1608LSYCK/J3-PRV. Yellow remains590nm;2mA type. Retain R15=6.8kohm: p.3typical graph implies roughly0.47mA/~6mcd at5V. Both LEDs require new symmetric manufacturer land:0.8×0.8mm pads at±0.825mm, cathode1/anode2, gap0.85mm. Original Footprint column is source provenance and MUST be replaced in the native candidate. Nominal height changes0.60→0.75mm; general±0.1mm means design bound0.85mm. Replace old AA1608model with manufacturer APT1608 STEP and verify registration/clearance. Stock/code research is not powered validation."
